# A table whose entry for one key is an optional field: indexing by that key gives no value.
-- source.cue --
k!: "x" | "y"
-- target.cue --
n!: int
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {n: {x?: 1, y: 2}[input.k]}
-- out --
not total
result.n indexes a table by input.k, which may be "x", for which the table has no entry (rule table-key-missing) @ lens.cue:2:13
